Error [E0113]: This lambda parameter should be Int (a whole number), not String (text)
  --> tests/ui/lambda_parameter_type_mismatch.jet:4:21
    |
  4 |     print(apply((n: String) -> 1))
    |                     ^^^^^^
 Why: A written lambda parameter type must equal the expected parameter type
 Fix: Use Int (a whole number) here
